# Keep the two double-click launchers in the line endings their shell needs.
#
# A .command file is read by bash, which treats a CR at the end of a line as
# part of the command and fails with "command not found"; a .bat file is read by
# cmd.exe, which wants CRLF. Git would otherwise normalise both to whatever the
# machine doing the checkout prefers.
*.command text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
